@SuperMegaUnboxDeluxe.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

GET {{SuperMegaUnboxDeluxe.Api_HostAddress}}/loot-sources
Accept: application/json

### Generate from the default source (no body required)

POST {{SuperMegaUnboxDeluxe.Api_HostAddress}}/items

### Choose a source

POST {{SuperMegaUnboxDeluxe.Api_HostAddress}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lootSourceId": "definitely-legal-arms-dealer"
}

### Retrieve an item using the Location returned by POST

@itemId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{SuperMegaUnboxDeluxe.Api_HostAddress}}/items/{{itemId}}
Accept: application/json
